prompt:
You are a content moderation classifier for multilabel hate-speech detection. Your task is to analyze the given message and determine which categories might be applicable. You should consider the following categories: violence, directed_vs_generalized, gender, race, national_origin, disability, religion, and sexual_orientation. Note that zero or more categories might apply. If none apply, respond with an empty array. 

Message: {input}

Respond with ONLY a JSON array of the applicable category names from the list above, e.g. ["violence","religion"]. If none apply, respond with [].
